Package: markerdata
Title: Marker Data Sets for Breeding Simulation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Samuel B.", "Fernandes", email = "samuelbf@uark.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8269-535X"))
Description: Curated single-nucleotide polymorphism (SNP) marker panels from
    public genomic resources, formatted as founder genotypes for breeding-program
    simulation with 'simplePHENOTYPES' and 'breedingDesigner'. One small maize
    panel is bundled; larger panels (cattle, eucalyptus, poplar, rice, sorghum,
    soybean, wheat) are downloaded on first use from the package's GitHub
    release and cached locally. Every data set is documented with its source
    repository, license and literature reference, which are also available as
    citation objects.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/fernandes-lab/markerdata
BugReports: https://github.com/fernandes-lab/markerdata/issues
